# PortalPulse Module 2 & Week 2.5 Summary

## Module 2 (Week 2) – Predictive Traffic Intelligence
- Build real-time predictive system for capacity limits and risk decisions
- Traffic Simulator with 5 scenarios (Result Rush, Exam Fee, Course Reg, etc.)
- Multi-target ML models (XGBoost primary, LightGBM secondary, MLP syllabus)
- Telemetry synthesizer + feature pipeline for live traffic input
- Deterministic Decision Engine (SAFE / WARNING / CRITICAL states)
- Live Streamlit dashboard with 5 core operational questions

## Week 2.5 – Production Backend, Auth & Load Testing
- Hybrid SQLite (WAL) + Redis caching layer with sub-ms reads
- 3-Role Quantum-Resistant Authentication (Student / Faculty / Admin keys)
- Real DB persistence + audit logging + 60-query stress benchmarks
- Virtual User Swarming for safe 5k–10k concurrent authenticated sessions
- 3-persona dashboard sidebar (Student / Faculty / Master Admin)
- Token-bucket Virtual Waiting Room + circuit breakers

## Key Architecture Highlights
- Multi-tier: Ingress (Nginx + Redis ZSET) → Application → Data Layer
- Application-aware predictive governor (vs Cloudflare edge CDN)
- Explainable, deterministic control actions
- Non-DDoS safe load testing with real HTTP/2 sessions

